# Prompt Engineering

Prompt Engineering is the practice of communicating effectively with language models to achieve reliable outputs.

This folder contains techniques, experiments, and prompt patterns for different use cases.

## Topics

- Zero-Shot Prompting
- One-Shot Prompting
- Few-Shot Prompting
- Chain of Thought
- ReAct
- Role Prompting
- Structured Prompts
- Prompt Chaining
- Prompt Evaluation

Prompting is only one layer of AI Engineering, but understanding it is essential.